{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":26.959999084472656,"text":"A young figure carved around 530 BC, with the small smile you see on many statues of that time. Patches of paint survive on her, red, green, traces of animal patterns on her clothes. This is the great secret of ancient sculpture, because the statues were not white. They were painted, bright, almost gaudy. The white marble we picture is simply the color that time washed off.","words":[{"word":"A","start":0,"end":0.5},{"word":"young","start":0.5,"end":0.7799999713897705},{"word":"figure","start":0.7799999713897705,"end":1.159999966621399},{"word":"carved","start":1.159999966621399,"end":1.559999942779541},{"word":"around","start":1.559999942779541,"end":1.9800000190734863},{"word":"530","start":1.9800000190734863,"end":2.640000104904175},{"word":"BC","start":2.640000104904175,"end":3.0199999809265137},{"word":"with","start":3.700000047683716,"end":3.7799999713897705},{"word":"the","start":3.7799999713897705,"end":3.9800000190734863},{"word":"small","start":3.9800000190734863,"end":4.28000020980835},{"word":"smile","start":4.28000020980835,"end":4.639999866485596},{"word":"you","start":4.639999866485596,"end":4.960000038146973},{"word":"see","start":4.960000038146973,"end":5.079999923706055},{"word":"on","start":5.079999923706055,"end":5.300000190734863},{"word":"many","start":5.300000190734863,"end":5.619999885559082},{"word":"statues","start":5.619999885559082,"end":5.860000133514404},{"word":"of","start":5.860000133514404,"end":6.139999866485596},{"word":"that","start":6.139999866485596,"end":6.340000152587891},{"word":"time","start":6.340000152587891,"end":6.619999885559082},{"word":"Patches","start":7.659999847412109,"end":7.78000020980835},{"word":"of","start":7.78000020980835,"end":8.020000457763672},{"word":"paint","start":8.020000457763672,"end":8.180000305175781},{"word":"survive","start":8.180000305175781,"end":8.5600004196167},{"word":"on","start":8.5600004196167,"end":8.8000001